# GRC Command Center — Backend Dependencies (top-level, human-edited)
# The image installs the COMPILED, hash-locked requirements.txt, never this file.
# After editing, recompile from backend/ inside a Linux container (markers differ on
# Windows); uv keeps every existing pin in requirements.txt unless told to upgrade it:
#   docker run --rm -v "<backend dir>:/w" -w /w python:3.11-slim sh -c "pip install uv &&
#     uv pip compile --python-version 3.11 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28
#     --generate-hashes --output-file requirements.txt requirements.in"
# See docs/refactors/DevSecOps_Pipeline_refactor.md (Phase 0, step 1).

