spacy==3.8.16
# spaCy's own low-level dependency. 3.0.14 (2026-10-24) was yanked upstream for a "Loading issue":
# with it, every tokenizer call raises OverflowError, so PII redaction failed closed and every
# question was refused (2026-10-26 rebuild). Fixed in 3.0.15. Treat a "yanked" warning from the
# compiler as a failure, never as noise.
preshed!=3.0.14
